  "body": "## Changelog\n\n## 🧰 Tasks\n- [c74e382](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/c74e382) **release**: prepare release v0.11.2\n- [c507131](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/c507131) Bump the production-dependencies-patch-updates group across 1 directory with 5 updates (#789), closes [#789](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/issues/789)\n- [0e7e9e5](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/0e7e9e5) Bump surefire.version from 3.5.6 to 3.6.0 (#785), closes [#785](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/issues/785)\n- [12b82dd](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/12b82dd) Bump the github-actions group across 1 directory with 4 updates (#791), closes [#791](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/issues/791)\n- [6c5392f](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/6c5392f) Bump org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-compiler-plugin (#786), closes [#786](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/issues/786)\n- [5044c79](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/5044c79) **deploy**: Update platform info for Snap package\n- [c3e0006](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/c3e0006) Bump org.jreleaser:jreleaser-maven-plugin from 1.25.0 to 1.26.0 (#784), closes [#784](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/issues/784)\n- [4021ab4](https://github.com/mthmulders/mcs/commits/4021ab4) **release**: prepare for next development iteration"
}
